<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 281 0 R
/E (In borrowing laboratory equipment in a school, the current process starts when a student gets a borrowing slip from the laboratory staff. The student fills out the required information and asks the professor to sign the slip for approval. Once the professor has signed the slip, the student will give the approved slip and their ID to the laboratory staff. The staff checks the approval of the professor based on the signature, then release the requested materials, and records its release and return.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
