<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 290 0 R
/T (When the dashboard wants to load data, it calls the csv_handler.read\(filepath\). The dashboard does not need to know how python opens a file, handles delimiters, or parses strings. The dashboard does not need to know the exact steps of how python opens a file, uses delimiters, or processes lists. It hides those unorganized details inside this method.)
/E (When the dashboard wants to load data, it calls the csv_handler.read\(filepath\). The dashboard does not need to know how python opens a file, handles delimiters, or parses strings. The dashboard does not need to know the exact steps of how python opens a file, uses delimiters, or processes lists. It hides those unorganized details inside this method.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [7]
>>
